Subject: [PATCH] Trust + funnel rework: soften revelation language,
 preview-first signup

- Frontend: free preview with dream-only form (name/email removed up front);
  email collected only at subscribe. 'Dominant Spirit' -> 'What feeling
  stood out most?' (optional). New sample-reflection step. Billing-clarity
  box (free vs paid, when charged, how to cancel) before checkout.
  Discernment framing throughout; Acts 2:17 kept with qualifier.
- Backend: DreamInput name/email optional; Dream columns nullable with
  idempotent Postgres startup migration; checkout accepts + stores email
  and requires it only at subscribe. AI prompts reframed as humble
  reflection guides ('possible themes', no fixed meanings, discernment
  note in every report). Email/PDF copy updated + None-safe names.
